# text = The matter-of-fact and doubtful folks , of whom there were a few among the Maypole customers , as unluckily there always are in every little community , were inclined to look upon this tradition as rather apocryphal ; but , whenever the landlord of that ancient hostelry appealed to the mounting block itself as evidence , and triumphantly pointed out that there it stood in the same place to that very day , the doubters never failed to be put down by a large majority , and all true believers exulted as in a victory .
