# text = At length Joe returned -- very talkative and conciliatory , as though with a strong presentiment that he was going to be found fault with he said , drawing a chair near the fire , and looking round for sympathy said the stranger replied Joe cried his father said Long Parkes murmured Tom Cobb exclaimed the parish-clerk , metaphorically reasoned poor Joe returned his father said Joe rebelliously retorted his father muttered Parkes , nodding gravely to the other two who nodded likewise , observing under their breaths that that was the point repeated John Willet said Parkes observed Mr Willet , blowing a long , thin , spiral cloud of smoke out of the corner of his mouth , and staring at it abstractedly as it floated away
