# text = By dint of relating the story very often , and ornamenting it ( according to village report ) with a few flourishes suggested by the various hearers from time to time , he had come by degrees to tell it with great effect ; and after the climax , was not what he was accustomed to he repeated said Joe returned the other At this remark , which evidently had reference to the scrutiny he had undergone , as mentioned in the foregoing chapter , the eyes of John Willet and his friends were diverted with marvellous rapidity to the copper boiler again .
