# text = Whether the traveller was possessed by thoughts which the fury of the night had heated and stimulated into a quicker current , or was merely impelled by some strong motive to reach his journey's end , on he swept more like a hunted phantom than a man , nor checked his pace until , arriving at some cross roads , one of which led by a longer route to the place whence he had lately started , he bore down so suddenly upon a vehicle which was coming towards him , that in the effort to avoid it he well-nigh pulled his horse upon his haunches , and narrowly escaped being thrown cried the voice of a man replied the traveller repeated the voice said the traveller dismounting cried the other returned the traveller , snatching it from his hand said the voice
