# text = On John Willet it made almost as much impression as on the sign outside the door , while Joe , who took it in the best part , avowed himself more obliged than he could well express , but politely intimated his intention nevertheless of taking his own course uninfluenced by anybody he said , as they stood without , in the porch , and the locksmith was equipping himself for his journey home said Gabriel replied Joe pursued the locksmith , stroking his chin reflectively said Joe -- finding , however , something very engrossing to do in the way of strapping and buckling said Joe after some hesitation returned Gabriel said the young fellow with a sigh
