# text = The good-natured locksmith was still patting her on the back and applying such gentle restoratives , when a message arrived from Mrs Varden , making known to all whom it might concern , that she felt too much indisposed to rise after her great agitation and anxiety of the previous night ; and therefore desired to be immediately accommodated with the little black teapot of strong mixed tea , a couple of rounds of buttered toast , a middling-sized dish of beef and ham cut thin , and the Protestant Manual in two volumes post octavo .
