# text = The young man smiled and shook his head ; at the same time moving in his chair as if in pain he said , in answer to the locksmith's sympathising look returned the locksmith , accommodating his action to his speech , and bending over him They both glanced at the subject of this remark , who had taken a seat on the other side of the fire , and , smiling vacantly , was making puzzles on his fingers with a skein of string said Varden , dropping his voice still lower said the locksmith said Varden he added , shaking the locksmith by the hand said Gabriel , bending down yet more , and looking cautiously towards their silent neighhour
