# text = It had been observed in this good lady ( who did not want for personal attractions , being plump and buxom to look at , though like her fair daughter , somewhat short in stature ) that this uncertainty of disposition strengthened and increased with her temporal prosperity ; and divers wise men and matrons , on friendly terms with the locksmith and his family , even went so far as to assert , that a tumble down some half-dozen rounds in the world's ladder -- such as the breaking of the bank in which her husband kept his money , or some little fall of that kind -- would be the making of her , and could hardly fail to render her one of the most agreeable companions in existence .
