# text = When particularly exasperated against them ( which , scandal said , was when Sim Tappertit slighted her most ) she was accustomed to wish with great emphasis that the whole race of women could but die off , in order that the men might be brought to know the real value of the blessings by which they set so little store ; nay , her feeling for her order ran so high , that she sometimes declared , if she could only have good security for a fair , round number -- say ten thousand -- of young virgins following her example , she would , to spite mankind , hang , drown , stab , or poison herself , with a joy past all expression .
