# text = Again the novice said Having said it , he listened meekly to the captain , who in an address prepared for such occasions , told him how that under that same Constitution ( which was kept in a strong box somewhere , but where exactly he could not find out , or he would have endeavoured to procure a copy of it ), the ' prentices had , in times gone by , had frequent holidays of right , broken people's heads by scores , defied their masters , nay , even achieved some glorious murders in the streets , which privileges had gradually been wrested from them , and in all which noble aspirations they were now restrained ; how the degrading checks imposed upon them were unquestionably attributable to the innovating spirit of the times , and how they united therefore to resist all change , except such change as would restore those good old English customs , by which they would stand or fall .
