# text = And there she stopped and shivered , for her modesty caught cold at the very thought cried Mr Tappertit , getting under the lamp , that she might see his eyes Miggs screamed slightly and it is impossible to describe the use he made of his eyes when he said this cried Miggs said Mr Tappertit said Miggs , hysterically said Mr Tappertit , with remarkable earnestness Miss Miggs , whose gentle heart was touched , did not wait for the oath ( knowing how strong the temptation was , and fearing he might forswear himself ), but tripped lightly down the stairs , and with her own fair hands drew back the rough fastenings of the workshop window .
