# text = Indeed , if he had been distracted in the first instance by questionings and orders , it would have taken him at the least a fortnight to have noted what is here set down ; but it happened that the gentleman , being struck with the old house , or with the plump pigeons which were skimming and curtseying about it , or with the tall maypole , on the top of which a weathercock , which had been out of order for fifteen years , performed a perpetual walk to the music of its own creaking , sat for some little time looking round in silence .
