# text = This was disconcerting ; for Joe being out , and Hugh engaged in rubbing down the chestnut cob , he designed sending on the errand , Barnaby , who had just then arrived in one of his rambles , and who , so that he thought himself employed on a grave and serious business , would go anywhere said John after a long pause said the guest , raising his eyes to John's fat face returned the landlord , his features turning quite expressive with surprise inquired the guest , leaning back in his chair ; speaking in the bland , even tone , from which he never varied ; and with the same soft , courteous , never-changing smile upon his face returned old John , after the usual pause to get the question in his mind said the guest carelessly John made answer returned the guest , taking a gold toothpick from his pocket with the same sweet smile said John with a puzzled look , as if it occurred to him , dimly and afar off , that this might by possibility be a cool way of treating the subject said the guest soliloquising he added , turning to John again answered John replied the guest John was so very much astonished to find who his visitor was , that he could express no astonishment at all , by looks or otherwise , but left the room as if he were in the most placid and imperturbable of all possible conditions .
