# text = With that , he put his hand , very much to John Willet's horror , on the guest's fine broadcloth sleeve , and led him stealthily to the back window he said softly returned the guest echoed Barnaby , looking close into his face , and falling quickly back With that , he waved his hat above his head , and darted off said the guest , pulling out a handsome box , and taking a pinch of snuff said Mr Willet , very slowly , and after a long silence John added this in confidence To record that Mr Chester smiled at John's remark would be little to the purpose , for he preserved the same conciliatory and pleasant look at all times .
