# text = Yet , though John Willet was full of wonder and misgiving , his guest sat cross-legged in the easy-chair , to all appearance as little ruffled in his thoughts as in his dress -- the same calm , easy , cool gentleman , without a care or thought beyond his golden toothpick John ventured to observe , as he placed a pair of tarnished candlesticks , some three feet high , upon the table , and snuffed the lights they held replied the guest , sipping his wine John coughed and raked the fire together said Mr Chester returned John Willet said the guest , shrugging his shoulders and wheeling his chair nearer to the fire John raked the faggots up again , more from habit than presence of mind , or any reference to this remark , and was about to withdraw , when a bounding step was heard upon the stair , and Barnaby came panting in he cried , advancing asked the visitor , looking up , but without the smallest discomposure -- or at least without the show of any Barnaby rejoined said the other , putting money in his hand , and glancing at him steadfastly .'
