# text = The negligence and disorder of the whole man , with something fierce and sullen in his features , gave him a picturesque appearance , that attracted the regards even of the Maypole customers who knew him well , and caused Long Parkes to say that Hugh looked more like a poaching rascal to-night than ever he had seen him yet said Solomon replied John Willet Following up this opinion with a shrug that seemed meant to say John put his pipe into his mouth again , and smoked like one who felt his superiority over the general run of mankind said John , taking it out again after a time , and pointing at him with the stem said Parkes , nodding his head said Mr Willet , not at all grateful for the compliment
