# text = John led the party to the best bedroom , which was nearly as large as the chamber from which they had come , and held , drawn out near the fire for warmth , a great old spectral bedstead , hung with faded brocade , and ornamented , at the top of each carved post , with a plume of feathers that had once been white , but with dust and age had now grown hearse-like and funereal said Mr Chester with a sweet smile , seating himself , when he had surveyed the room from end to end , in the easy-chair which his attendants wheeled before the fire Barnaby nodded returned old John , officiously said Mr Chester , turning to him he answered pointing to Barnaby John whispered in his ear with dignity
