# text = First , he resolved to stroll up another street for five minutes , then up another street for five minutes more , and so on until he had lost full half an hour , when he made a bold plunge and found himself with a red face and a beating heart in the smoky workshop said Varden , rising from the desk at which he was busy with his books , and looking at him under his spectacles said the locksmith said Gabriel , dropping his voice , and shaking his head Joe replied , and endeavouring , but not with the greatest possible success , to hide his disappointment said the locksmith , patting him on the back Dear heart , how the words stuck in his throat said Gabriel thought Joe The locksmith settled the doubt as neatly as if it had been expressed aloud , by leading him to the door , and saying Now , Mrs Varden , regarding the Maypole as a sort of human mantrap , or decoy for husbands ; viewing its proprietor , and all who aided and abetted him , in the light of so many poachers among Christian men ; and believing , moreover , that the publicans coupled with sinners in Holy Writ were veritable licensed victuallers ; was far from being favourably disposed towards her visitor .
