# text = Here a pair of lovers met to quarrel and make up ; there a dark-eyed nursery-maid had better eyes for Templars than her charge ; on this hand an ancient spinster , with her lapdog in a string , regarded both enormities with scornful sidelong looks ; on that a weazen old gentleman , ogling the nursery-maid , looked with like scorn upon the spinster , and wondered she didn't know she was no longer young .
