# text = As he spoke , the figure rose , and came towards him with a rapid pace said the father , resuming his newspaper with a yawn Presently the room-door opened , and the young man entered ; to whom his father gently waved his hand , and smiled said Edward cried his father , contemplating him from behind the toothpick , with a languid smile said Edward , bringing a chair forward , and seating himself near the table returned his father said Edward returned his father , crossing his legs said the son , with an air of great concern cried his father returned the son .
