# text = His imperturbable parent sipped his tea said the young man , stopping at length before him returned the other said Edward interrupted his father with a compassionate smile said his son firmly returned his father , taking a pinch of snuff and pushing his box towards him rejoined his son said his smiling father said Edward returned his father , laying down the newspaper at which he had been glancing carelessly , and throwing himself back in the window-seat Edward having obeyed him , he took an elegant little knife from his pocket , and paring his nails , continued said Edward cried his father , raising his eyelids in a languishing surprise said Edward returned his father with great composure said Edward said his father coolly cried the son , indignantly returned the father
