# text = While incidents like these , arising out of drums and masquerades and parties at quadrille , were passing at the west end of the town , heavy stagecoaches and scarce heavier waggons were lumbering slowly towards the city , the coachmen , guard , and passengers , armed to the teeth , and the coach -- a day or so perhaps behind its time , but that was nothing -- despoiled by highwaymen ; who made no scruple to attack , alone and single-handed , a whole caravan of goods and men , and sometimes shot a passenger or two , and were sometimes shot themselves , as the case might be .
