# text = Next night , when he had eat his poor meal voraciously ( he was accustomed to do that , they had observed , as though he had no other in the day ), this fellow sat down at his elbow cried the fellow , urged on by the looks of his comrades , and slapping him on the shoulder returned the stranger , looking up said the fellow , as the stranger disclosed his haggard unwashed face , and torn clothes replied the other , shaking him roughly off said the fellow returned the other , rising and turning upon him , and looking fiercely round as if in apprehension of a general attack .
