# text = To be sure Dolly was confused when she bowed again , and to be sure the cherry-coloured ribbons trembled a little when she met his mournful eye , which seemed to say There he stood , rooted to the ground : as Dolly said , like a statue ; and as Mrs Varden said , like a pump ; till they turned the corner : and when her father thought it was like his impudence , and her mother wondered what he meant by it , Dolly blushed again till her very hood was pale .
