# text = Having clasped it on her arm , and again advised her half in jest and half in earnest to amend her roguish ways , for she knew she was fond of Joe at heart ( which Dolly stoutly denied , with a great many haughty protestations that she hoped she could do better than that indeed ! and so forth ), she bade her farewell ; and after calling her back to give her more supplementary messages for Edward , than anybody with tenfold the gravity of Dolly Varden could be reasonably expected to remember , at length dismissed her .
