# text = After glancing at herself as a comparatively worthless vessel , but still as one of some desert , she besought her to bear in mind that her aforesaid dear and only mother was of a weakly constitution and excitable temperament , who had constantly to sustain afflictions in domestic life , compared with which thieves and robbers were as nothing , and yet never sunk down or gave way to despair or wrath , but , in prize-fighting phraseology , always came up to time with a cheerful countenance , and went in to win as if nothing had happened .
