# text = The very letter that had cost her so much trouble said Mr Chester , casting his eye upon it without the least perceptible surprise or pleasure said Hugh said Mr Chester gaily said the other , in a drawling manner , for he was fixing a very small patch of sticking plaster on a very small pimple near the corner of his mouth replied Hugh , after some hesitation said Mr Chester , in the same easy tone , and smiling twice or thrice to try if the patch adhered Hugh with a muttered oath thrust his hand into his breast , and drawing the bracelet forth , wrapped in a scrap of hay , was about to lay it on the table likewise , when his patron stopped his hand and bade him put it up again he said he added , turning away his head said Hugh bluntly , despite the increasing awe in which he held him striking the letter with his heavy hand said Mr Chester coolly Hugh drew his sleeve across his lips , and gruffly answered yes He obeyed .
