# text = You were drinking before you came here cried Hugh boisterously , waving the empty glass above his head , and throwing himself into a rude dancing attitude said Mr Chester , putting on his cravat with great deliberation , and slightly moving his head from side to side to settle his chin in its proper place said Hugh baring the brawny limb to the elbow said Mr Chester cried Hugh said his patron , putting on his waistcoat with great nicety , and taking no heed of this request said Mr Chester Hugh fell back a pace or two and surveyed him with a look of mingled terror , indignation , and surprise .
