# text = The room in which they used to be ; the spot in which his cradle stood ; he , old and elfin-like in face , but ever dear to her , gazing at her with a wild and vacant eye , and crooning some uncouth song as she sat by and rocked him ; every circumstance of his infancy came thronging back , and the most trivial , perhaps , the most distinctly .
