# text = Mr Tappertit , who was hard at work by lamplight , in a corner of the workshop , remained unconscious of his presence until a hand upon his shoulder made him start and turn his head said Mr Chester returned the ' prentice , laying down his hammer , and rubbing his nose on the back of a very sooty hand said Sim , standing up to get nearer to his ear , and whispering hoarsely said Mr Chester returned Sim , eyeing him over with a look of concentrated expression Mr Chester nodded said Sim , wiping his face upon his apron Mr Tappertit raised himself on tiptoe , applied his lips to Mr Chester's ear , drew back his head without saying anything , looked hard at him , applied them to his ear again , again drew back , and finally whispered Having said that much , he beckoned the visitor with a mysterious aspect to follow him to the parlour-door , where he announced him in the voice of a gentleman-usher said Sim , looking into the door again , and adding this by way of postscript in his own person said Mr Chester , advancing hat in hand , as he observed the effect of this last explanatory announcement exclaimed Miggs , clapping her hands said Mr Chester in his softest tones returned Mrs V ., blushing with great juvenility cried the visitor Dolly showed some reluctance to perform this ceremony , but was sharply reproved by Mrs Varden , who insisted on her undergoing it that minute .
