# text = As Mrs Varden distinctly heard , and was intended to hear , all that Miggs said , and as these words appeared to convey in metaphorical terms a presage or foreboding that she would at some early period droop beneath her trials and take an easy flight towards the stars , she immediately began to languish , and taking a volume of the Manual from a neighbouring table , leant her arm upon it as though she were Hope and that her Anchor .
