# text = Mr Chester lighted the candles which stood upon his dressing-table , and wheeling an easy-chair towards the fire , which was yet burning , stirred up a cheerful blaze , sat down before it , and bade his uncouth visitor and draw his boots off he said , as Hugh went down on one knee , and did as he was told said Mr Chester Hugh obeyed in silence said Mr Chester , as he put them on Hugh obeyed again even more zealously -- and having done so , presented himself before his patron said Mr Chester returned Hugh smiled Mr Chester said Mr Chester , composedly said Mr Chester , twirling Dolly's note between his finger and thumb , and feigning to be surprised retorted Hugh said Mr Chester said Hugh , disconcerted by this reproof , for he had expected high praise returned his patron , putting it away after a moment's consideration said Mr Chester , as coolly as if she were one of his ordinary acquaintance Hugh understood him perfectly .
