# text = But as he was never known to be guilty of such lightness of conduct either before or afterwards , this may be looked upon as a malicious invention of his enemies -- founded , perhaps , upon the undisputed circumstance of his taking his guest by the third breast button of his coat , counting downwards from the chin , and pouring his reply into his ear whispered John , with dignity said Mr Chester , who naturally thought that being on patrole , implied walking about somewhere returned John When he had communicated this bright idea , which had its origin in the perusal by the village cronies of a newspaper , containing , among other matters , an account of how some officer pending the sentence of some court-martial had been enlarged on parole , Mr Willet drew back from his guest's ear , and without any visible alteration of feature , chuckled thrice audibly .
