# text = This nearest approach to a laugh in which he ever indulged ( and that but seldom and only on extreme occasions ), never even curled his lip or effected the smallest change in -- no , not so much as a slight wagging of -- his great , fat , double chin , which at these times , as at all others , remained a perfect desert in the broad map of his face ; one changeless , dull , tremendous blank .
