# text = She inclined her head , and stopping , cast her eyes upon the ground She put hers in it as he said these words , and suffered him to lead her to a neighbouring seat she said in a low voice he answered , sitting down beside her She bowed her head again , and made as though she would have begged him to proceed ; but said nothing she interposed with an altered manner and a firmer voice she replied , with a heightened colour in her cheek She rose as she spoke , and would have left him ; but he detained her with a gentle hand , and besought her in such persuasive accents to hear him but another minute , that she was easily prevailed upon to comply , and so sat down again said Mr Chester , looking upward , and apostrophising the air She turned towards him quickly , and with a scornful look and flashing eyes .
