# text = But neither voice nor footstep came ; and though some distant echoes , as of closing doors and people hurrying in and out of rooms , resounding from time to time through the great passages , and penetrating to his remote seclusion , gave note of unusual commotion downstairs , no nearer sound disturbed his place of retreat , which seemed the quieter for these far-off noises , and was as dull and full of gloom as any hermit's cell .
