# text = She had no sooner left the workshop than there cautiously peered out from behind the chimney of the forge , a face which had already emerged from the same concealment twice or thrice , unseen , and which , after satisfying itself that it was now alone , was followed by a leg , a shoulder , and so on by degrees , until the form of Mr Tappertit stood confessed , with a brown-paper cap stuck negligently on one side of its head , and its arms very much a-kimbo said the ' prentice , ' or do I dream ! am I to thank thee , Fortun ', or to cus thee -- which ?'
