# text = So they remained for some time : the father lying on a sofa with his accustomed air of graceful negligence ; the son seated opposite to him with downcast eyes , busied , it was plain , with painful and uneasy thoughts said Mr Chester at length , with a most engaging laugh Edward begged his pardon , passed it , and relapsed into his former state said Mr Chester , holding up his own before the light cried his son interposed the parent hastily , as he set down his glass , and raised his eyebrows with a startled and horrified expression returned Edward said Mr Chester , raising his delicate hand imploringly returned his son said Mr Chester , sipping his wine returned his son , seeing that he paused for him to speak said Mr Chester , as a careless illustration of his meaning cried Edward , reddening said his father cried Edward , rising from his seat returned his father gaily returned his son interposed his father said Edward warmly returned his father , raising himself a little on the sofa , and looking straight towards him said Edward His father rose a little higher still , and looking at him as though curious to know if he were quite resolved and earnest , dropped gently down again , and said in the calmest voice -- eating his nuts meanwhile ,
