# text = In private dwellings , children clustered near the blaze ; listening with timid pleasure to tales of ghosts and goblins , and tall figures clad in white standing by bed-sides , and people who had gone to sleep in old churches and being overlooked had found themselves alone there at the dead hour of the night : until they shuddered at the thought of the dark rooms upstairs , yet loved to hear the wind moan too , and hoped it would continue bravely .
