# text = All eyes were fastened on Solomon he said said Tom Cobb , in a low voice Solomon Daisy raised his glass to his lips ; put it down upon the floor with such a trembling hand that the spoon tinkled in it like a little bell ; and continued thus Here old John precipitately interrupted the speaker , and begged that if Mr Parkes ( who was seated opposite to him and was staring directly over his head ) saw anything , he would have the goodness to mention it .
