# text = So they made head against the wind as they best could ; Hugh crushing the wet grass beneath his heavy tread , and stalking on after his ordinary savage fashion ; John Willet following at arm's length , picking his steps , and looking about him , now for bogs and ditches , and now for such stray ghosts as might be wandering abroad , with looks of as much dismay and uneasiness as his immovable face was capable of expressing .
