# text = At the word John plucked up his spirit in a surprising manner ; his fears rolled off like smoke ; all the landlord stirred within him rejoined Mr Willet , with a strong emphasis on the plural number said the horseman , smiling replied John , greatly wondering how he had found this out John was going to add that it was the easiest mile in all the world , when the third rider , who had hitherto kept a little in the rear , suddenly interposed answered John interposed the gentleman who had spoken before said the speaker , rising in his stirrups exclaimed his lordship , lifting up his hat with great solemnity said the long-winded gentleman , in a tone of mild reproof said the man , sitting like a statue on his horse To which John Grueby made no reply at all , but sat looking straight before him said the gentleman cied the man , gruffly , ' where's the use of talking of Bloody Mary , under such circumstances as the present , when my lord's wet through , and tired with hard riding ?
