# text = He was considering whether it was at all possible to insert any novel sentences to the same purpose , when the gentleman who had spoken first , turning to him of the long wind , exclaimed returned the person he appealed to , in a silky tone here his lordship pulled off his hat again , though it was raining hard said Lord George Gordon said John Grueby , in a low voice interposed Mr Gashford , falling back hastily John made no answer , but looking straight before him , as his custom seemed to be when the secretary spoke , bade Hugh push on , and followed close behind him .
