# text = Such were the guests whom old John Willet , with a fixed and leaden eye , surveyed a hundred times , and to whom he now advanced with a state candlestick in each hand , beseeching them to follow him into a worthier chamber said John -- it is odd enough , but certain people seem to have as great a pleasure in pronouncing titles as their owners have in wearing them With this address , John ushered them upstairs into the state apartment , which , like many other things of state , was cold and comfortless .
