# text = And here he sighed , and warmed his hands , and shook his head as men do when their hearts are full , and heaved another sigh , and warmed his hands again said Lord George , who was lying broad awake , upon his side , and had been staring at him from his entrance said Gashford , starting and looking round as though in great surprise he repeated , with assumed confusion exclaimed the secretary , drawing his sleeve in a hasty way across his eyes said the poor lord , stretching out his hand with manifest emotion Gashford made no reply , but grasped the hand and pressed it to his lips .
