# text = Quite unconscious , however , of the effect he produced , he trotted on beside his secretary , talking to himself nearly all the way , until they came within a mile or two of London , when now and then some passenger went by who knew him by sight , and pointed him out to some one else , and perhaps stood looking after him , or cried in jest or earnest as it might be At which he would gravely pull off his hat , and bow .
