# text = There were some men at the other end of the room ( which was a long , low-roofed chamber ) in earnest conversation all the time ; and when any of this group went out , fresh people were sure to come in soon afterwards and sit down in their places , as though the others had relieved them on some watch or duty ; which it was pretty clear they did , for these changes took place by the clock , at intervals of half an hour .
