# text = When I look at that hand He heaved a deep sigh as he indulged in these reflections , and putting his fingers with an absent air on Hugh's throat , and particularly under his left ear , as if he were studying the anatomical development of that part of his frame , shook his head in a despondent manner and actually shed tears said Mr Tappertit rejoined Dennis that's my motto said Mr Tappertit taking his stick out of his hand Dennis replied said Mr Tappertit repeated Dennis , gazing fondly on his image said Mr Tappertit rejoined the other , breathing on his fictitious nose , and polishing it with the cuff of his coat said Mr Tappertit he answered with a curious look remarked Mr Tappertit , looking at him sideways said Dennis , with a little hesitation Mr Tappertit glanced at the article referred to , and appeared to think that the deceased's ideas of dress were of a peculiar and by no means an expensive kind .
