# text = Whereat Hugh cheered and laughed , and ran off like a greyhound said Simon , turning thoughtfully upon his heel Little thinking of the plan for his happy settlement in life which had suggested itself to the teeming brain of his provident commander , Hugh made no pause until Saint Dunstan's giants struck the hour above him , when he worked the handle of a pump which stood hard by , with great vigour , and thrusting his head under the spout , let the water gush upon him until a little stream ran down from every uncombed hair , and he was wet to the waist .
