# text = His questioning was so artfully contrived , that he seemed even in his own eyes to volunteer all this information rather than to have it wrested from him ; and he was brought to this state of feeling so naturally , that when Mr Chester yawned at length and declared himself quite wearied out , he made a rough kind of excuse for having talked so much said Sir John , holding the door open in his hand retorted Hugh , stopping in his passage out and looking back said Sir John Hugh nodded , and touching his cap with an air of as much respect as he could summon up , departed .
