# text = Tink , tink , tink -- clear as a silver bell , and audible at every pause of the streets' harsher noises , as though it said Women scolded , children squalled , heavy carts went rumbling by , horrible cries proceeded from the lungs of hawkers ; still it struck in again , no higher , no lower , no louder , no softer ; not thrusting itself on people's notice a bit the more for having been outdone by louder sounds -- tink , tink , tink , tink , tink .
