# text = It was a perfect embodiment of the still small voice , free from all cold , hoarseness , huskiness , or unhealthiness of any kind ; foot - passengers slackened their pace , and were disposed to linger near it ; neighbours who had got up splenetic that morning , felt good - humour stealing on them as they heard it , and by degrees became quite sprightly ; mothers danced their babies to its ringing ; still the same magical tink , tink , tink , came gaily from the workshop of the Golden Key .
