# text = As the locksmith put his mug down , empty , on the bench whence it had smiled on him before , he glanced at these articles with a laughing eye , and looking at them with his head a little on one side , as though he would get them all into a focus , said , leaning on his hammer sighed Mrs Varden , who had entered unobserved said the locksmith , turning round with a smile replied Mrs V . with great demureness began the locksmith said his wife rejoined the locksmith cried Mrs Varden , shaking her head said the locksmith Mrs Varden looked at the ceiling , as in expectation that the consequence of this profanity would be the immediate descent of the four-post bedstead on the second floor , together with the best sitting-room on the first ; but no visible judgment occurring , she heaved a deep sigh , and begged her husband , in a tone of resignation , to go on , and by all means to blaspheme as much as possible , because he knew she liked it .
