# text = She held that , in such stirring and tremendous times as those in which they lived , it would be much more to the purpose if Dolly became a regular subscriber to the Thunderer , where she would have an opportunity of reading Lord George Gordon's speeches word for word , which would be a greater comfort and solace to her , than a hundred and fifty Blue Beards ever could impart .
