# text = That Dolly , she was grieved to say , was no less backward in her contributions , better loving , as it seemed , to purchase ribbons and such gauds , than to encourage the great cause , then in such heavy tribulation ; and that she did entreat her ( her father she much feared could not be moved ) not to despise , but imitate , the bright example of Miss Miggs , who flung her wages , as it were , into the very countenance of the Pope , and bruised his features with her quarter's money said Miggs cried Miggs with a great burst of tears -- for with her they never came on by degrees
