# text = As she never failed to keep her self-denial full in Mrs Varden's view , it drew forth so many gifts of caps and gowns and other articles of dress , that upon the whole the red-brick house was perhaps the best investment for her small capital she could possibly have hit upon ; returning her interest , at the rate of seven or eight per cent in money , and fifty at least in personal repute and credit said Mrs Varden , herself in tears Miggs howled at this remark , in a peculiarly dismal way , and said she knowed that master hated her .
