# text = As he made his way among the throng , he heard once or twice the No-Popery cry , which was then becoming pretty familiar to the ears of most men ; but holding it in very slight regard , and observing that the idlers were of the lowest grade , he neither thought nor cared about it , but made his way along , with perfect indifference .
