# text = Here , a dozen squabbling urchins made a very Babel in the air ; there , a solitary man , half clerk , half mendicant , paced up and down with hungry dejection in his look and gait ; at his elbow passed an errand-lad , swinging his basket round and round , and with his shrill whistle riving the very timbers of the roof ; while a more observant schoolboy , half-way through , pocketed his ball , and eyed the distant beadle as he came looming on .
