# text = Great heaps of ashes ; stagnant pools , overgrown with rank grass and duckweed ; broken turnstiles ; and the upright posts of palings long since carried off for firewood , which menaced all heedless walkers with their jagged and rusty nails ; were the leading features of the landscape : while here and there a donkey , or a ragged horse , tethered to a stake , and cropping off a wretched meal from the coarse stunted turf , were quite in keeping with the scene , and would have suggested ( if the houses had not done so , sufficiently , of themselves ) how very poor the people were who lived in the crazy huts adjacent , and how foolhardy it might prove for one who carried money , or wore decent clothes , to walk that way alone , unless by daylight .
