# text = He sat quite silent until they were serious again , and then said , looking round interposed the hangman with a grave nod Feeling the subject much too vast for expression , he puffed at his pipe again , and looked the rest resumed the secretary , in a slow , impressive way said Gashford , pausing , and pressing his hands together gently cried Hugh said Gashford , shaking him by the hand He was gone , and had shut the door behind him .
