# text = She little thought then , that a circumstance so slight would ever influence their future fortunes ; but time and experience enlightened her in this respect said Barnaby , as they were sitting next day in a waggon which was to take them within ten miles of the capital She was about to answer but checked herself , and told him No , she thought not ; why did he ask said Barnaby , with a thoughtful countenance she asked said Barnaby , looking wistfully at her He laughed and bade her say that again , then cried and laughed once more .
