# text = Whether the idea of wealth had occurred to him for the first time on looking at the golden clouds that evening -- and images were often presented to his thoughts by outward objects quite as remote and distant ; or whether their poor and humble way of life had suggested it , by contrast , long ago ; or whether the accident ( as he would deem it ) of the blind man's pursuing the current of his own remarks , had done so at the moment ; or he had been impressed by the mere circumstance of the man being blind , and , therefore , unlike any one with whom he had talked before ; it was impossible to tell .
