# text = Observing them , and seeing how Barnaby was occupied , they stopped , whispered together for an instant , turned back , and came over to them said one of them , who was dressed in a plain suit of black , wore long lank hair , and carried a great cane replied Barnaby , finishing his task , and putting his hat on with an air of pride said the second gentleman mildly said Lord George , as Barnaby pulled off his hat again and made him a low bow , ' it's no great matter on a day like this , which every Englishman will remember with delight and pride .
