# text = Then they burst into a tremendous shout , into another , and another ; and the air seemed rent and shaken , as if by the discharge of cannon cried Lord George , pressing his secretary's arm tight within his own , and speaking with as much emotion in his voice , as in his altered face said the secretary cried his master , catching him by both hands ; for he had made a show of kneeling at his feet Gashford slid his cold insidious palm into his master's grasp , and so , hand in hand , and followed still by Barnaby and by his mother too , they mingled with the concourse .
