# text = As the whole stream turned at once , Barnaby and Hugh went with it : and so , fighting and struggling and trampling on fallen men and being trampled on in turn themselves , they and the whole mass floated by degrees into the open street , where a large detachment of the Guards , both horse and foot , came hurrying up ; clearing the ground before them so rapidly that the people seemed to melt away as they advanced .
