# text = Simon meanwhile , without once stopping , fled at the same degree of swiftness to The Boot , where , as he well knew , some of his company were lying , and at which respectable hostelry -- for he had already acquired the distinction of being in great peril of the law -- a friendly watch had been expecting him all night , and was even now on the look-out for his coming said the locksmith , as soon as he could speak So saying , and shaking his head in a very sorrowful and disconsolate manner , he turned back , and soon re-entered his own house , where Mrs Varden and the faithful Miggs had been anxiously expecting his return .
