# text = The hangman struggled into a sitting posture directly , and with his eyes wide open , looked towards him said Gashford , nodding returned the hangman , staring at him he added , with a muttered oath -- still staring at him in a thoughtful manner he answered , scratching his head , and keeping his eyes upon the secretary's face said Gashford , in his unvarying , even tone Mr Dennis looked round as in expectation of beholding him asleep upon his bed of straw ; then remembering he had seen him go out , replied said the secretary Dennis , who was very much baffled by the cool matter-of-course manner of this reply , recovered his self-possession on his professional pursuits being referred to , and pointing towards Barnaby , shook his head and frowned cried Barnaby said the hangman in a low voice he answered he cried , joyfully welcoming Hugh with both hands , and then patting him fondly on the back , as if instead of being the rough companion he was , he had been one of the most prepossessing of men said Hugh , shaking hands with him with a kind of ferocious friendship , strange enough to see cried Barnaby , waving his hat returned his friend , dropping his hand , and looking at Gashford for an instant with a changed expression before he spoke to him replied the secretary , nursing his leg said Hugh , wiping his face cried Gashford , raising his eyebrows with an exclamation of surprise he smilingly asked , as he took a large paper from his pocket , unfolded it , and held it out for Hugh's inspection said Hugh replied the secretary said Hugh , impatiently said Gashford cried Hugh , with an indifferent air said Gashford , smiling , and folding up the document again stammered Hugh , with an unsuccessful effort to appear surprised retorted Gashford , rubbing his hands , and beating the back of one on the palm of the other , and looking at him with a cunning eye said Hugh , with a hasty glance towards Dennis resumed the secretary , after a moment's pause Hugh would have prevented his uttering the word , but it was out already .
