# text = On this very evening , and perhaps at the very time when Gashford kept his solitary watch , old John was so red in the face with perpetually shaking his head in contradiction of his three ancient cronies and pot companions , that he was quite a phenomenon to behold , and lighted up the Maypole Porch wherein they sat together , like a monstrous carbuncle in a fairy tale said Mr Willet , looking hard at Solomon Daisy -- for it was his custom in cases of personal altercation to fasten upon the smallest man in the party returned Solomon , looking round upon the little circle of which he formed a part Mr Cobb and Mr Parkes shook their heads in unison , muttering But as such compliments had usually the effect of making Mr Willet rather more dogged than before , he surveyed them with a look of deep disdain , and returned for answer said Mr Willet , putting his pipe in his mouth with an air of solemn disgust pleaded Parkes , humbly repeated Mr Willet , eyeing him from top to toe said the adventurous Mr Parkes Mr Parkes , finding himself in the position of having got into metaphysics without exactly seeing his way out of them , stammered forth an apology and retreated from the argument .
