# text = The word was again passed , and presently Mr Dennis , with a long cord bound about his middle , something after the manner of a friar , came hurrying in , attended by a body-guard of half-a-dozen of his men cried Hugh , stamping his foot upon the ground Dennis , with a wink and a nod , unwound the cord from about his person , and raising his eyes to the ceiling , looked all over it , and round the walls and cornice , with a curious eye ; then shook his head cried Hugh , with another impatient stamp of his foot answered Dennis , stepping towards him and here he whispered in his ear Hugh demanded retorted Dennis cried Hugh returned the hangman with a stare Hugh made no answer , but snatching the rope from his companion's hand , proceeded to bind old John himself ; but his very first move was so bungling and unskilful , that Mr Dennis entreated , almost with tears in his eyes , that he might be permitted to perform the duty .
