# text = Hugh consenting , be achieved it in a twinkling he said , looking mournfully at John Willet , who displayed no more emotion in his bonds than he had shown out of them Hugh , inferring what his companion meant , rather from his gestures than his technical mode of expressing himself ( to which , as he was ignorant of his calling , he wanted the clue ), rejected this proposition for the second time , and gave the word which was echoed by a hundred voices from without shouted Dennis as he ran out , followed by the rest A loud yell followed , and the whole throng hurried off , mad for pillage and destruction .
