# text = Currents of air rushed in , as the old doors jarred and creaked upon their hinges ; the candles flickered and guttered down , and made long winding-sheets ; the cheery deep-red curtains flapped and fluttered idly in the wind ; even the stout Dutch kegs , overthrown and lying empty in dark corners , seemed the mere husks of good fellows whose jollity had departed , and who could kindle with a friendly glow no more .
