# text = His comrade Grip , the partner of his watch , though fond of basking in the sunshine , preferred to-day to walk about the stable ; having a great deal to do in the way of scattering the straw , hiding under it such small articles as had been casually left about , and haunting Hugh's bed , to which he seemed to have taken a particular attachment .
