# text = But as she said these latter words , the idea that he had fallen in a general massacre of the Catholics that night -- no very wild or improbable supposition after what they had seen and undergone -- struck her dumb ; and , lost in the horrors they had witnessed , and those they might be yet reserved for , she sat incapable of thought , or speech , or outward show of grief : as rigid , and almost as white and cold , as marble .
