# text = They paused for a moment , going out , to look at them clasped in each other's arms , and then left the cottage ; fastening the door , and setting a good watch upon it , and indeed all round the house growled Dennis , as they walked away in company said Hugh , hastily said Dennis Strike who dead ?' demanded Hugh answered Dennis Hugh looked , for a moment , as though he would have made some further inquiry into this incoherent recollection ; but Simon Tappertit , who had been meditating deeply , gave his thoughts a new direction said Sim returned that gentleman , stroking his grizzly beard , which was some two inches long said Sim he turned to Hugh Hugh thanked him heartily ; and as he did so , his laughing fit returned with such violence that he was obliged to hold his side with one hand , and to lean with the other on the shoulder of his small captain , without whose support he would certainly have rolled upon the ground
