# text = The three worthies turned their faces towards The Boot , with the intention of passing the night in that place of rendezvous , and of seeking the repose they so much needed in the shelter of their old den ; for now that the mischief and destruction they had purposed were achieved , and their prisoners were safely bestowed for the night , they began to be conscious of exhaustion , and to feel the wasting effects of the madness which had led to such deplorable results .
