# text = Notwithstanding the lassitude and fatigue which oppressed him now , in common with his two companions , and indeed with all who had taken an active share in that night's work , Hugh's boisterous merriment broke out afresh whenever he looked at Simon Tappertit , and vented itself -- much to that gentleman's indignation -- in such shouts of laughter as bade fair to bring the watch upon them , and involve them in a skirmish , to which in their present worn-out condition they might prove by no means equal .
