# text = It pursues him through his dreams , gnaws at the heart of all his fancied pleasures , robs the banquet of its taste , music of its sweetness , makes happiness itself unhappy , and yet is no bodily sensation , but a phantom without shape , or form , or visible presence ; pervading everything , but having no existence ; recognisable everywhere , but nowhere seen , or touched , or met with face to face , until the sleep is past , and waking agony returns .
