# text = As the young lady had given no tokens of consciousness on their way downstairs , the bearer reported her either dead or dying ; and being at some loss what to do with her , was looking round for a convenient bench or heap of ashes on which to place her senseless form , when she suddenly came upon her feet by some mysterious means , thrust back her hair , stared wildly at Mr Tappertit , cried and dropped into his arms with such promptitude that he staggered and reeled some paces back , beneath his lovely burden said Mr Tappertit cried Miss Miggs , in tears , and faintly said Mr Tappertit , in a very unresponsive tone murmured Miggs answered Simon , testily cried Miggs cried Mr Tappertit he cried to one of the bystanders , in whose ear he whispered for a moment
