# text = He made as though he would retire when he said these words , but he was checked by the voice of the locksmith cried Gabriel replied the governor , turning towards the speaker , and waving his hand said Gabriel cried the governor in an altered voice rejoined the locksmith said the governor said the locksmith , turning round upon them said the jailer , hastily interposed the locksmith , who felt that the tone in which this was said , conveyed the speaker's impression that he had ample excuse for yielding to the furious multitude who beset and hemmed him in , on every side , and among whom he stood , an old man , quite alone said the keeper , anxiously Hugh replied he answered
