# text = In many instances their efforts were successful ; which occasioned a new and appalling addition to the horrors of the scene : for the prisoners within , seeing from between their bars that the fire caught in many places and thrived fiercely , and being all locked up in strong cells for the night , began to know that they were in danger of being burnt alive .
