# text = This terrible fear , spreading from cell to cell and from yard to yard , vented itself in such dismal cries and wailings , and in such dreadful shrieks for help , that the whole jail resounded with the noise ; which was loudly heard even above the shouting of the mob and roaring of the flames , and was so full of agony and despair , that it made the boldest tremble .
