# text = Still , though the jail resounded with shrieks and cries for help ,-- though the fire bounded up as if each separate flame had had a tiger's life , and roared as though , in every one , there were a hungry voice -- though the heat began to grow intense , and the air suffocating , and the clamour without increased , and the danger of his situation even from one merciless element was every moment more extreme ,-- still he was afraid to raise his voice again , lest the crowd should break in , and should , of their own ears or from the information given them by the other prisoners , get the clue to his place of confinement .
