# text = But in this reckoning they were cruelly mistaken , for in half an hour , or less , as though the setting in of night had been their preconcerted signal , the rioters having previously , in small parties , prevented the lighting of the street lamps , rose like a great sea ; and that in so many places at once , and with such inconceivable fury , that those who had the direction of the troops knew not , at first , where to turn or what to do .
