# text = One after another , new fires blazed up in every quarter of the town , as though it were the intention of the insurgents to wrap the city in a circle of flames , which , contracting by degrees , should burn the whole to ashes ; the crowd swarmed and roared in every street ; and none but rioters and soldiers being out of doors , it seemed to the latter as if all London were arrayed against them , and they stood alone against the town .
