# text = The vintner and Mr Haredale , unable to sit quietly listening to the noise without seeing what went on , had climbed to the roof of the house , and hiding behind a stack of chimneys , were looking cautiously down into the street , almost hoping that after so many repulses the rioters would be foiled , when a great shout proclaimed that a parry were coming round the other way ; and the dismal jingling of those accursed fetters warned them next moment that they too were led by Hugh .
