# text = But his glance at Edward Chester , and that gentleman's keeping aloof , were not lost upon Joe , who said bluntly , glancing at Edward while he spoke cried Mr Haredale said Joe cried Joe said Edward murmured Joe , as he dropped the flaring link upon the ground , crushed it with his foot , and gave his hand to Mr Haredale Both Mr Haredale and the worthy vintner were too amazed and too much hurried to ask any further questions , so followed their conductors in silence .
