# text = Joe still holding Mr Haredale tight , and Edward taking the same care of the vintner , they hurried through the streets at a rapid pace ; occasionally standing aside to let some fugitives go by , or to keep out of the way of the soldiers who followed them , and whose questions , when they halted to put any , were speedily stopped by one whispered word from Joe While Newgate was burning on the previous night , Barnaby and his father , having been passed among the crowd from hand to hand , stood in Smithfield , on the outskirts of the mob , gazing at the flames like men who had been suddenly roused from sleep .
