# text = He sat beside him all that day ; listening for her footsteps in every breath of air , looking for her shadow on the gently-waving grass , twining the hedge flowers for her pleasure when she came , and his when he awoke ; and stooping down from time to time to listen to his mutterings , and wonder why he was so restless in that quiet place .
