# text = He was in the act of drinking , when the front of the shed was suddenly darkened , and Dennis stood before them said that personage in a conciliatory tone , as Hugh stopped in his draught , and eyed him , with no pleasant look , from head to foot Notwithstanding that he spoke in this very friendly and confident manner , he seemed to have considerable hesitation about entering , and remained outside the roof .
