# text = Mr Dennis was immediately to seek out from among the rioters , some daring young fellow ( and he had one in his eye , he said ), who , terrified by the threats he could hold out to him , and alarmed by the capture of so many who were no better and no worse than he , would gladly avail himself of any help to get abroad , and out of harm's way , with his plunder , even though his journey were incumbered by an unwilling companion ; indeed , the unwilling companion being a beautiful girl , would probably be an additional inducement and temptation .
