# text = Miss Miggs remarked , and very justly , as an abstract sentiment which happened to occur to her at the moment , that she dared to say the locksmith and his wife would murmur , and repine , if they were ever , by forcible abduction , or otherwise , to lose their child ; but that we seldom knew , in this world , what was best for us : such being our sinful and imperfect natures , that very few arrived at that clear understanding .
