# text = Indeed , she returned so often to these sublects , and so frequently called upon them to take a lesson from her ,-- at the same time vaunting and , as it were , rioting in , her huge unworthiness , and abundant excess of sin ,-- that , in the course of a short time , she became , in that small chamber , rather a nuisance than a comfort , and rendered them , if possible , even more unhappy than they had been before .
