# text = He shrugged his shoulders , shook his head , lifted up his hands ; and with the same smooth smile , which was not a pleasant one to see , cast his eyes upon the ground , and remained silent said Emma But here Dolly interposed , and entreated her not to hear the worst , but the best ; and besought the gentleman to tell them the best , and to keep the remainder of his news until they were safe among their friends again he said , glancing at the locksmith's daughter with a look of some displeasure said Emma , faltering cried Dolly , pointing at him earnestly he replied , frowning angrily upon her There was a reproof conveyed in these words , which to a nature like Emma Haredale's , was well addressed .
