# text = Wondering no longer at the moans they had heard , Dolly kept closer to her father , and shuddered at the sight ; but neither bruises , burns , nor gun-shot wound , nor all the torture of his shattered limbs , sent half so keen a pang to Simon's breast , as Dolly passing out , with Joe for her preserver .
