# text = As Dolly glanced towards him , and thought of the pain he must have suffered , and the far-off places in which he had been wandering , and wondered who had been his nurse , and hoped that whoever it was , she had been as kind and gentle and considerate as she would have been , the tears came rising to her bright eyes , one by one , little by little , until she could keep them back no longer , and so before them all , wept bitterly said her father , kindly
