# text = But Mrs Varden being quite an altered woman -- for the riots had done that good -- added her word to his , and comforted her with similar representations said Mr Willet , senior , looking round upon the company The Black Lion , who , like old John , had been waiting supper past all reasonable and conscionable hours , hailed this as a philosophical discovery of the profoundest and most penetrating kind ; and the table being already spread , they sat down to supper straightway .
