# text = The strong military force disposed in every advantageous quarter , and stationed at every commanding point , held the scattered fragments of the mob in check ; the search after rioters was prosecuted with unrelenting vigour ; and if there were any among them so desperate and reckless as to be inclined , after the terrible scenes they had beheld , to venture forth again , they were so daunted by these resolute measures , that they quickly shrunk into their hiding-places , and had no thought but for their safety .
