# text = He joyfully replied that this was well , and what he wished , and what he had felt quite certain she would tell him ; and then he asked her where she had been so long , and why she had not come to see him when he had been a great soldier , and ran through the wild schemes he had had for their being rich and living prosperously , and with some faint notion in his mind that she was sad and he had made her so , tried to console and comfort her , and talked of their former life and his old sports and freedom : little dreaming that every word he uttered only increased her sorrow , and that her tears fell faster at the freshened recollection of their lost tranquillity said Barnaby , as they heard the man approaching to close the cells for the night she made answer said Barnaby she whispered in his ear Barnaby recoiled in horror , and glancing at his stained wrist for an instant , wrapped it , shuddering , in his dress she added hastily as the key turned in the lock She tore herself away , and in a few seconds Barnaby was alone .
