# text = Even the timorous Lord Mayor , who was summoned that night before the Privy Council to answer for his conduct , came back contented ; observing to all his friends that he had got off very well with a reprimand , and repeating with huge satisfaction his memorable defence before the Council On that night , too , more of the scattered remnants of the mob were traced to their lurking-places , and taken ; and in the hospitals , and deep among the ruins they had made , and in the ditches , and fields , many unshrouded wretches lay dead : envied by those who had been active in the disturbances , and who pillowed their doomed heads in the temporary jails .
