# text = He rested his arms upon his knees , and stooping forward , looked from beneath his shaggy hair at Dennis , with something of a smile upon his face said the hangman , in a tone of greater confidence said Hugh , contracting his brows Finishing this speech with a growl like the yawn of a wild beast , he stretched himself upon the bench again , and closed his eyes once more .
