# text = After two or three ineffectual twitches at his dress , which he was hardy enough to venture upon , notwithstanding his dangerous humour , Mr Dennis , who burnt , for reasons of his own , to pursue the conversation , had no alternative but to sit as patiently as he could : waiting his further pleasure A month has elapsed ,-- and we stand in the bedchamber of Sir John Chester .
