# text = He quickly subdued it , however , and said in the same light tone returned the locksmith , gravely Sir John Chester settled himself in a position of greater repose , and looked at his visitor with an expression of face which seemed to say said Gabriel , pointing to the one which lay by his side cried Sir John said the locksmith , taking no notice of these compliments Sir John fanned himself gently with the newspaper , and nodded resumed Gabriel said Sir John continued Gabriel , looking steadily at the knight , ' that he had sent to me , because he had no friend or companion in the whole world ( being the common hangman ), and because he believed , from the way in which I had given my evidence , that I was an honest man , and would act truly by him .
