# text = The locksmith going on , arrested it half-way Sir John drew back his outstretched hand , and seeing that the locksmith paused , signed to him with easy politeness and without any new appearance of emotion , to proceed Sir John took a pinch of snuff ; glanced approvingly at an elegant little sketch , entitled on the wall ; and raising his eyes to the locksmith's face again , said , with an air of courtesy and patronage returned the locksmith , who was not to be diverted by any artifice from his firm manner , and his steady gaze exclaimed the knight , pausing in the act of raising his cup to his lips with a perfectly steady hand , and curling up his little finger for the better display of a brilliant ring with which it was ornamented returned the locksmith said Sir John , bantering him with a gay air returned the locksmith
