# text = Say you do , young man said Hugh cried the wretched object ,-- so mean , and wretched , and despicable , that even Pity's self might have turned away , at sight of such a being in the likeness of a man he almost shrieked , as he wrung his hands said Hugh , stopping before him cried Dennis , actually writhing as he spoke said Hugh , as he thrust back his matted hair to get a better view of his late associate screamed the miserable creature said Hugh , resuming his walk Although one of these men displayed , in his speech and bearing , the most reckless hardihood ; and the other , in his every word and action , testified such an extreme of abject cowardice that it was humiliating to see him ; it would be difficult to say which of them would most have repelled and shocked an observer .
