# text = They knew its import well cried Hugh , undaunted by the sound The Ordinary coming up at this moment , reproved him for his indecent mirth , and advised him to alter his demeanour said Hugh he cried , as the other would have spoken observed the clergyman , shaking his head rejoined Hugh sternly He pointed , as he spoke , to Dennis , who , with his legs trailing on the ground , was held between two men ; and who trembled so , that all his joints and limbs seemed racked by spasms .
