# text = He no sooner came into the place he knew so well , however , and among faces with which he was so familiar , than he recovered strength and sense enough to clasp his hands and make a last appeal cried the abject creature , grovelling down upon his knees , and actually prostrating himself upon the stone floor said the governor of the jail cried the trembling wretch , looking wildly round for sympathy he implored , clenching his hands and glaring round , and round , and round again said a gentleman who stood by , after a moment's pause cried the criminal , shuffling towards this speaker on his knees , and holding up his folded hands
