# text = It was a sad sight -- all the show , and strength , and glitter , assembled round one helpless creature -- and sadder yet to note , as he rode along , how his wandering thoughts found strange encouragement in the crowded windows and the concourse in the streets ; and how , even then , he felt the influence of the bright sky , and looked up , smiling , into its deep unfathomable blue .
