# text = It don't matter what Joe said in answer , but he said a great deal ; and Dolly said a great deal too : and he folded Dolly in his one arm pretty tight , considering that it was but one ; and Dolly made no resistance : and if ever two people were happy in this world -- which is not an utterly miserable one , with all its faults -- we may , with some appearance of certainty , conclude that they were .
