# text = At the expiration of that period , he suddenly , and without the least notice , burst ( to the great consternation of the young people ) into a very loud and very short laugh ; and repeating went out for a walk Old John did not walk near the Golden Key , for between the Golden Key and the Black Lion there lay a wilderness of streets -- as everybody knows who is acquainted with the relative bearings of Clerkenwell and Whitechapel -- and he was by no means famous for pedestrian exercises .
