# text = To see how she came in , arm-in-arm with Joe ; and how she made an effort not to blush or seem at all confused ; and how she made believe she didn't care to sit on his side of the table ; and how she coaxed the locksmith in a whisper not to joke ; and how her colour came and went in a little restless flutter of happiness , which made her do everything wrong , and yet so charmingly wrong that it was better than right !-- why , the locksmith could have looked on at this ( as he mentioned to Mrs Varden when they retired for the night ) for four - and-twenty hours at a stretch , and never wished it done .
