# text = In this extremity she fell on the unlucky nephew , tooth and nail , and plucking a handful of hair from his head , demanded to know how long she was to stand there to be insulted , and whether or no he meant to help her to carry out the box again , and if he took a pleasure in hearing his family reviled : with other inquiries of that nature ; at which disgrace and provocation , the small boy , who had been all this time gradually lashed into rebellion by the sight of unattainable pastry , walked off indignant , leaving his aunt and the box to follow at their leisure .
