# text = Somehow or other , by dint of pushing and pulling , they did attain the street at last ; where Miss Miggs , all blowzed with the exertion of getting there , and with her sobs and tears , sat down upon her property to rest and grieve , until she could ensnare some other youth to help her home whispered the locksmith , as he followed his wife to the window , and good - humouredly dried her eyes Another month had passed , and the end of August had nearly come , when Mr Haredale stood alone in the mail-coach office at Bristol .
